{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17628","headline":"郡斋读经 · 羊士谔","name":"郡斋读经","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壮龄非济物，柔翰误爲儒。\n及此斋心暇，翛然与道俱。\n散材诚独善，正觉岂无徒。\n半偈莲生水，幽香桂满炉。\n息阴慙蔽芾，讲义得醍醐。\n迹似桃源客，身撄竹使符。\n华夷参吏事，巴汉混州图。\n偃草怀君子，移风念啬夫。\n翳桑俄有绩，宿麦复盈租。\n圆寂期超诣，凋残幸已苏。\n解空囊不智，灭景谷何愚。\n几日遵归辙，东菑殆欲芜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}